@startuml
title Asset Lifecycle State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "UNREGISTERED" as Unregistered
state "ACTIVE" as Active
state "DEREGISTERED" as Deregistered

[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Active : register asset and RFID tag
Active --> Deregistered : deregister asset
Deregistered --> Active : register again

note bottom of Deregistered
Historical detections and movement
records remain available.
end note
@enduml
